=2 Walkthrough
To win this assault, subdue at least one Lamia or Merrow by breaking its weapon.
* Weapons can sometimes be broken using critical-hit weaponskills and critical hits.
** At iLvl, a {p:Dual Wield} job like {p:Red Mage} with {s:Haste II}/{p:Temper II}/etc and two DMG1 daggers would usually break the weapons in about 10 seconds.
* Once the Lamia or Merrow has been disarmed, it will immediately surrender, becoming an NPC.
* There are 12 Lamia and Merrow.
** The mission can be completed at any time after the first successful subdual by talking to the NPC at the start. Subduing more monsters will result in a higher point reward.
** Once all 12 have been killed or subdued, the {p:Rune of Release} will automatically spawn if at least one has been subdued.

The {p:Rune of Release} will spawn at the starting NPC.
